{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-225558-r4610531","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Vegetable Spring Roll","sourcePageId":225558,"sourceRevision":"4610531","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2026-01-05T00:09:00Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Vegetable%20Spring%20Roll&oldid=4610531","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:29:16.734Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Appetizer recipes","Category:Asian recipes","Category:Deep fried recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour","Category:Recipes using bean sprout","Category:Recipes using cabbage","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using chile","Category:Recipes using egg","Category:Recipes using fresh ginger","Category:Recipes using leek","Category:Recipes using mushroom","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Side dish recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"17383e1996912d0780c88fb2f25e1c8041d8653f66d6124c8a36a8178a040e64","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Appetizer recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n==Ingredients==\n\n=== Batter ===\n*250 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Egg|egg]]\n*A little [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*Water\n*[[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]]\n\n===Filling ===\n*Oil\n*2–3 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]], [[Cookbook:Grater|grated]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Leek|leeks]] or [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]] (optional)\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] fresh [[Cookbook:Ginger|ginger]]\n*½ tsp minced [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n*100 g shredded [[Cookbook:Cabbage|cabbage]]\n*50 g chopped [[Cookbook:Mushroom|mushrooms]]\n*75 g [[Cookbook:Bean Sprout|bean sprouts]]\n*3 green [[Cookbook:Chiles|chiles]], chopped\n*Salt to taste\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soya sauce]]\n*½ tbsp white [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n\n=== Assembly ===\n\n* [[Cookbook:Flour|Flour]]\n* Water\n* [[Cookbook:Oil and Fat|Oil]] for [[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|deep frying]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n=== Batter ===\n#[[Cookbook:Sifting|Sift]] the flour, then mix in salt, egg, and enough water to make a smooth batter.\n#Heat little oil in a flat non-stick [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|pan]] and add enough batter so that it covers the base of the pan.\n#Cook both sides of the pancake until golden.\n#Repeat the cooking process until all the batter is used up.\n\n=== Filling ===\n#Heat 2–3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] oil in a [[Cookbook:Wok|wok]], then add ginger, garlic, and mushrooms, and [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|stir fry]] for 10–15 seconds.\n#Add leeks, and stir fry for about 1 minute. Add carrots and cabbage, then cook, [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|tossing]] the vegetables until they are crisp-tender.\n#Add the bean sprouts, salt, pepper, and soya sauce. Cook, stirring, for 2 minutes.\n#Set the filling aside to cool.\n\n=== Assembly ===\n#Place 2–3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] of the filling in the center of each pancake.\n#Fold in the sides and form a tight roll, sealing the edge with a little flour and water paste.\n#[[Cookbook:Deep Fat Frying|Deep fry]] in hot oil until golden.\n#Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Deep fried recipes]]\n[[Category:Side dish recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Asian recipes]]\n[[Category:Appetizer recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bean sprout]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cabbage]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using leek]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mushroom]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Vegetable Spring Roll","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"250 g all-purpose flour","sourceText":"250 g all-purpose flour","amountText":"250 g all-purpose flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 egg","sourceText":"1 egg","amountText":"1 egg","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"A little salt","sourceText":"A little salt","amountText":"A little salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Water","sourceText":"Water","amountText":"Water","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Oil","sourceText":"Oil","amountText":"Oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Oil","sourceText":"Oil","amountText":"Oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"2–3 carrots, grated","sourceText":"2–3 carrots, grated","amountText":"2–3 carrots, grated","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"1 cup chopped leeks or onion (optional)","sourceText":"1 cup chopped leeks or onion (optional)","amountText":"1 cup chopped leeks or onion (optional)","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"½ tsp minced fresh ginger","sourceText":"½ tsp minced fresh ginge